    "headline_insight": {
      "as_of": "2026-06-26T05:24:41.385829+00:00",
      "insight": "Readers click BitGo not for custody mechanics but for trust failures: who controls the Bitcoin backing WBTC, whether DeFi protocols will limit exposure, and whether regulators will finally validate BitGo's institutional ambitions — three distinct anxieties that all reduce to the same question of whether BitGo's counterparty risk is priced in.",
